Package: HERVariumR
Title: Fast Functional Annotation and Comparison of Human Endogenous Retrovirus Lists
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Tomàs", "Montserrat-Ayuso", 
           email = "tomas.montserrat@cnag.eu", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to annotate and compare lists of human endogenous retrovirus
    loci using HERVarium annotation layers, including internal retroviral domains,
    LTR-associated transcription factor binding motifs, RBP motifs, transcript
    context, IFN-related LTR features, and interactive HTML dashboards.
